只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Log directly into your Cursor account within DeepSeek Harness and use your Cursor subscription — no API Key required, and no dependency on Cursor IDE or Cursor CLI. 在 DeepSeek Harness 中直接登录 Cursor 账户并使用 Cursor 订阅，不需要 API Key， 也不依赖 Cursor IDE 或 Cursor CLI。","id":"gh:1338662309","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-cursor-subscription","slug":"orrinzeng/dsh-cursor-subscription","topics":["acp","cursor","deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Log directly into your Cursor account within DeepSeek Harness and use your Cursor subscription — no "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"API Key required, and no dependency on Cursor IDE or Cursor CLI. 在 DeepSeek Harness 中直接登录 Cursor 账户并"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"使用 Cursor 订阅，不需要 API Key， 也不依赖 Cursor IDE 或 Cursor CLI。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Cursor Subscription"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Sign in to your Cursor account and use your Cursor subscription directly from DeepSeek Harness—witho"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ut an API key and without depending on the Cursor IDE or Cursor CLI. The plugin preserves DSH's exis"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ting session, tool, and permission systems: once signed in, you can select Cursor subscription model"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"s from the model picker, while agent tool calls are executed through DSH's local toolset."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> ⚠️ This plugin integrates with Cursor's unpublished Agent protocol (`agent.v1.AgentService/Run`). "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"It is a community reverse-engineering project and may stop working when Cursor changes its server-si"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"de implementation. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Anysphere or Cursor. Please co"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"mply with Cursor's terms of service."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Use a Cursor subscription directly in DSH through browser-based PKCE sign-in—no API key required.\n"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"- Store credentials in DSH's local credential store and refresh access tokens automatically.\n- Disco"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ver models available to the current account dynamically through Cursor's `GetUsableModels`, with a b"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"uilt-in fallback list if discovery fails.\n- Stream conversations with reasoning output, image attach"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"ments, and DSH tool calls.\n- View sign-in status and token expiration in the settings page, which la"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"bels itself with the installed build version.\n- View and manually refresh subscription usage as Curs"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"or's own dashboard lays it out: an included-usage table with the Cursor Models and Other Models pool"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"s, each followed by the models that drew on it, with token counts and percentages per row, plus incl"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"uded requests, on-demand spend, and the billing cycle.\n- View and manually refresh the models availa"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"ble to the current account, listed by name instead of Cursor's response order.\n- Configure the per-r"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"un tool-round limit, the HTTP retry policy, and whether every step replays the full history from the"},{"id":"p7s12","text":" settings page.\n- Read the settings page in Simplified Chinese, English, Traditional Chinese, Japane"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"se, Korean, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Brazilian Portuguese, Russian, or Arabic. The panel mi"},{"id":"p7s14","text":"rrors itself for Arabic; contributed languages join DSH's own language picker under **Settings → Gen"},{"id":"p7s15","text":"eral → Language** and fall back to English outside the panel."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Install with an Agent (Recommended)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Send the agent a link to AGENTS.md. It contains the instructions for installation, updates, removal,"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ink to AGENTS.md. It contains the instructions for installation, updates, removal, and verification."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Manual Installation with the `dsh` Command"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The installed package list should contain exactly one `dsh-cursor-subscription`, and the composed co"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"nfiguration should contain exactly one `cursor-subscription` entry."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"pnpm 11 and later ship a built-in 24-hour `minimumReleaseAge` gate, so a plain `add` never selects a"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" version published within the last 24 hours. Right after a release, install it explicitly (`dsh plug"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"in --profile web add dsh-cursor-subscription@0.5.8`) or exempt this package by name in the profile's"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" `pnpm-workspace.yaml`:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Local Development Installation"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Run the following command in the profile directory, such as `%USERPROFILE%\\.dsh\\profiles\\web`:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Then add `dsh-cursor-subscription` to the `dsh.profile.bundles` array in `package.json` and restart "},{"id":"p19s2","text":" add `dsh-cursor-subscription` to the `dsh.profile.bundles` array in `package.json` and restart DSH."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Sign-in and Usage"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"1. Open **Settings -> Cursor Subscription** in DSH.\n2. Select **Browser Sign-in**. Your browser will"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" open the Cursor sign-in page.\n3. Complete sign-in and authorization. The settings page will automat"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ically show that you are signed in.\n4. Select a Cursor model from the model picker, such as `compose"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"r-2` or `claude-4-sonnet`."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"When a tool is required, the agent converts Cursor's tool request into a local DSH tool execution. T"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"he result is returned to the model through the conversation history; Cursor's filesystem tools are n"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ot used. When Cursor asks for one of its own built-in tools instead — including a tool newer than th"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"is build knows — the plugin declines that request right away, telling the model to use the DSH tools"},{"id":"p22s5","text":", so the run continues instead of waiting for a result that will never come."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The **Runtime settings** card controls the maximum tool rounds in one Cursor run, the HTTP retry pol"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"icy, and whether each step replays the full history. The tool-round cap defaults to `200` (range 1–1"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"000) and ends the run with `TOOL_LIMIT` when exceeded. Retry count means additional attempts and def"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"aults to `0` (disabled). Cursor's streaming POST protocol cannot prove that a failed attempt was not"},{"id":"p23s5","text":" processed remotely, so enabling retries may repeat model work or usage. Retries occur only before a"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"ny response output when the initial HTTP status matches the configured list. **Replay the full histo"},{"id":"p23s7","text":"ry each step** is off by default: it rebuilds the Cursor conversation from the DSH history on every "},{"id":"p23s8","text":"step instead of resuming the conversation Cursor keeps server-side, which is what an adapter that re"},{"id":"p23s9","text":"-sends its own history does — at the cost of re-sending the transcript each step, since Cursor has n"},{"id":"p23s10","text":"o provider-side compaction to bound it."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Updating and Removing"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"If DSH is running, restart it manually after installation or an update."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Scope and Support"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- Image *input* (user-uploaded attachments) is supported. Cursor-native features such as image gener"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ation and web search remain outside this plugin's scope.\n- Report problems through the repository's "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"b search remain outside this plugin's scope.\n- Report problems through the repository's Issues page."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
